flowchart TB
    HUMAN[Human / Developer] --> AGENT[Codex / Claude / Other Agent]
    AGENT --> HOOK[UserPromptSubmit / PreToolUse Hook]
    HOOK --> CORE[Rust Concept Guard Core]
    AGENT --> MCP[MCP stdio tools]
    MCP --> CORE
    REQ[Existing approved requirements] --> PARSER[Parser and fingerprint]
    PARSER --> BLINE[Protected requirement baseline]
    BLINE --> CORE
    CORE --> IDX[(SQLite cache and FTS5)]
    CORE --> REVIEW[Candidate divergence / Concept discussion]
    REVIEW --> HUMAN
    CORE --> DIFF[Git staged or branch diff evidence]
    DIFF --> CI[Required CI]
    BLINE --> CI
    CI --> PROTECTED[Protected main branch]
